// Motion capture from Mixamo (mixamo.com), taken from the X Bot, Soldier and Michelle models that ship
// with the three.js examples, and baked offline into the joint angles of the rig in actors.js
// by tools/bake-mocap.mjs.
// Each clip is n frames of 30 channels in poseHumanoid's layout, stored as little-endian int16 / 4000
// in base64. Walk and run loops are lined up so a quarter of the way in, the left thigh is furthest forward;
// stride is metres per loop.
// idle, walk, run (X Bot) and idleS, walkS, runS (Soldier): absolute poses. sneak, sad: one-frame
// offsets. agree, shake: offsets from frame 0.
// dance: absolute, 15 fps.
